zone:0:200:0:200:-50:0:the 2nd level looks the exact as the first, however its appearance does not deceive you at all. the air seems off here, as if polluted or corrupted somehow. the scremes of the dead echo in your ears, as you are left to wonder how many have attempted to reach the demon king...and how many have survived. the urge to flea and never look back, or to think of this nightmarish dungeon grabs you in its clutches completely, however now you remain here not by your own will, but by a compulsion centuries old. now you remain under the will of the demon king...and the only way out is to slay him, or to be killed yourself.
